_diagram.png" class=3D"mw-file-description" title=3D"Diagonal"><img alt=3D"=
Diagonal" src=3D"https://www.nesdev.org/w/images/default/thumb/b/b8/Diagona=
l_mirroring_diagram.png/120px-Diagonal_mirroring_diagram.png" decoding=3D"a=
sync" width=3D"120" height=3D"113" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a></span></d=
iv>
