L-shaped" src=3D"https://www.nesdev.org/w/images/default/thumb/7/79/L-shape=
d_mirroring_diagram.png/120px-L-shaped_mirroring_diagram.png" decoding=3D"a=
sync" width=3D"120" height=3D"113" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a></span></d=
iv>
