gram.png" class=3D"mw-file-description" title=3D"3-screen vertical"><img al=
t=3D"3-screen vertical" src=3D"https://www.nesdev.org/w/images/default/thum=
b/0/08/ACBC_mirroring_diagram.png/120px-ACBC_mirroring_diagram.png" decodin=
g=3D"async" width=3D"120" height=3D"113" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a></sp=
an></div>
			<div class=3D"gallerytext">3-screen vertical</div>
		</li>
