gram.png" class=3D"mw-file-description" title=3D"3-screen horizontal"><img =
alt=3D"3-screen horizontal" src=3D"https://www.nesdev.org/w/images/default/=
thumb/2/2f/ABCC_mirroring_diagram.png/120px-ABCC_mirroring_diagram.png" dec=
oding=3D"async" width=3D"120" height=3D"113" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a>=
</span></div>
			<div class=3D"gallerytext">3-screen horizontal</div>
		</li>
		<li class=3D"gallerybox" style=3D"width: 155px">
			<div class=3D"thumb" style=3D"width: 150px; height: 150px;"><span typeof=
