gram.png" class=3D"mw-file-description" title=3D"3-screen diagonal"><img al=
t=3D"3-screen diagonal" src=3D"https://www.nesdev.org/w/images/default/thum=
b/9/9c/ABBC_mirroring_diagram.png/120px-ABBC_mirroring_diagram.png" decodin=
g=3D"async" width=3D"120" height=3D"113" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a></sp=
an></div>
